; Desert Eagle table — Counter-Strike 1.6 reference values.
; Scalars: https://csjs.live/weapons/deagle (54 dmg, 75% armor, 267 RPM /
; 0.225 s effective cycle, 81% per 500 u, 2 penetration stages, 7+35 ammo,
; 250 u/s), cross-checked with https://counterstrike.fandom.com/wiki/Desert_Eagle.
; Code constants: https://github.com/s1lentq/ReGameDLL_CS
; - regamedll/dlls/weapons.h: DEAGLE_DAMAGE 54, DEAGLE_RANGE_MODIFER 0.81,
;   DEAGLE_MAX_SPEED 250.
; - regamedll/dlls/wpn_shared/wpn_deagle.cpp PrimaryAttack: air 1.5*(1-acc),
;   move(>0u/s) 0.25*(1-acc), duck 0.115*(1-acc), stand 0.13*(1-acc);
;   effective cycle 0.3-0.075 = 0.225 s; FireBullets3 penetration 2,
;   BULLET_PLAYER_50AE. First-shot spreads below use fresh accuracy 0.9,
;   atan(spread) to degrees: stand 0.7448, duck 0.6589, move 1.4321,
;   air 8.5308.
; - regamedll/dlls/weapontype.h: DEAGLE_MAX_CLIP 7, MAX_AMMO_50AE 35.
; - regamedll/dlls/player.cpp TraceAttack: HITGROUP_HEAD damage x4;
;   TakeDamage: ARMOR_RATIO 0.5 x 1.5 (WEAPON_DEAGLE) = 0.75.
; - regamedll/dlls/cbase.cpp FireBullets3: falloff pow(rangeMod, dist/500);
;   wall damage x0.6 (CHAR_TEX_WOOD), penetration skip 30 u/stage
;   (BULLET_PLAYER_50AE).
; RecoilTable: semi-auto has no learned spray; 7 cumulative entries encode a
; heavy per-shot climb (~1.1-1.6 deg/shot, punchangle.x -= 2 feel) with a
; slight right-then-left yaw. COMMUNITY CONSENSUS.
; MaxWallThicknessU 32: consensus (pistol-class wallbang, near engine 30 u).
[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="WeaponData" load_steps=2 format=3]

